      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW GERTRUDE (6) has shown good improvement at her last two starts, most recently finishing 3rd at Warragul over 460m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Deserves serious consideration. SWEET LOVE (4) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at her last four runs. Last start finished 2nd on November 15 over 300m at Healesville behind Dundee Skye beaten 1.5 lengths (16.89) in a Grade 5. Well-placed to take this out. SLICK ABILITY (1) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (23.69) from Box 5 at this track. The form out of last race has been strong. Likely to be in the finish again. PAW ISLA (2) was strongly fancied last time on the back of some good recent form but could only manage third (24.10) at this track. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win.",
